eam/apps/2134690/extras/263807fa3ed1254ed7114b249e186271.mp4?t=1754564148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ARM YOURSELF TO THE TEETH</strong><br>From a nail gun to a deadly shotgun, you'll have to gather an arsenal of weapons to face your enemies. Each shot counts, and every weapon could be your last hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT TO SURVIVE</strong><br>Time is running out, and your body is slowly shutting down. You'll need to rely on your adrenaline and quick reflexes to stay alive.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/c56c58b711a27615c4c82f8a4fc156f8.poster.avif?t=1754564148\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/c56c58b711a27615c4c82f8a4fc156f8.webm?t=1754564148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/c56c58b711a27615c4c82f8a4fc156f8.mp4?t=1754564148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NEED A DOSE?</strong><br>Find and use different injections throughout the game to enhance your abilities. Whether you need a health boost or increased agility, these shots might be your only hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CRAFT YOUR OWN DEATHTRAPS</strong><br>Get creative and design your own deadly levels with the custom editor. Add your favorite music and share your creation with the world. The bloodbath doesn't have to end.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/27dd6e7ba1fb90a08285d4710841c142.poster.avif?t=1754564148\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/27dd6e7ba1fb90a08285d4710841c142.webm?t=1754564148\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2134690/extras/27dd6e7ba1fb90a08285d4710841c142.mp4?t=1754564148\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
